@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Consultar catálogo de ejemplos HTTP disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/loadouts/examples
Accept: application/json

### 2. Listar todos los equipamientos (loadouts) de Battle Royale
GET {{baseUrl}}/loadouts
Accept: application/json

### 3. Obtener un loadout específico por su ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/loadouts/LDT-01
Accept: application/json

### 4. Desplegar un nuevo loadout válido (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loadouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "squadName": "Valkyrie Squad",
  "dropZone": "Military Base",
  "primaryWeapon": "Subfusil Vector Táctico",
  "rarityTier": "Epico",
  "shieldCapacity": 150
}

### 5. Probar error de validación (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loadouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "squadName": "X",
  "dropZone": "",
  "primaryWeapon": "No",
  "rarityTier": "Inexistente",
  "shieldCapacity": 999
}

### 6. Probar recurso inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loadouts/LDT-999
Accept: application/json
